      "writtenOn": "2026-10-28T22:02:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This removes the refusal from aosp/4368078, so uprobes are installed in 4KB processes again. Could `uprobe_p3s.c` from aosp/4367986 move into this patch? It tests exactly this change (a probe one slice past native alignment, the reference counter, an unmatched trap and the XOL fallback) and only needs `P3S_COMPAT_MAIN()`, so the change and its test would land together.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "8665129a6c8af58a58334fa98b9d1d0a4998349e",
